SECTION 1 — APPLICATION OVERVIEW
Application Purpose
A multi-market algorithmic trading platform combining a high-performance Go execution engine, a Python AI strategy service, and a Next.js dashboard. It supports paper trading (mock), live trading (Binance futures, Angel One equities, Delta Exchange options), and a multi-agent AI research tournament for strategy promotion.

Main Features
Real-time BTC perpetual futures paper & live trading via Binance WebSocket
120+ registered strategies evaluated on every market tick
Multi-model AI consensus engine (GPT-4o, GPT-4o-mini, Gemini Flash 2.0, Llama-3-70b)
Research tournament: strategies earn promotion by hitting statistical thresholds
Options chain viewer (Delta Exchange — BTC)
NIFTY 50 equities (Angel One / NSE)
MCX commodities (crude oil, gold)
Full analytics: Sharpe, Sortino, Calmar, Monte Carlo, equity curves
Dual persistence: MongoDB Atlas + local filesystem backup
Vercel-hosted dashboard, AWS Lightsail / Render Go engine
