SECTION 3 — MOCK TRADING AUDIT
Trade Creation Path
Signals arrive via /api/mock-trading/signals or the research tournament API → enter mockTradingEngine.ts → evaluateMockTradeOpenRisk() → if approved → position created in client-side state → persisted to MongoDB via /api/mock-trading/trades.

Trade Rejection Path
All rejections are captured as MockRejectionEvent with a typed reason field. The funnel is:

All Rejection Reasons (Ranked by Impact)
Rank	Rejection Reason	What It Means	Impact
1	EXPOSURE_LIMIT	Max 5 open trades reached, or long/short side cap hit (max 3 each)	CRITICAL — Most common silent blocker
2	LOW_SIGNAL_SCORE	Signal score below minSignalScore (default: 50)	CRITICAL — High-volume gate
3	DAILY_LOSS_LIMIT	Rolling 24h loss > 3% of starting equity	HIGH — Entire trading suspended
4	COOLDOWN	Strategy re-entry lockout active (15 min)	HIGH — Kills frequency strategies
5	REGIME	Market regime classifier blocked the signal	HIGH — Regime mismatch
6	LOW_CONFIDENCE	Confidence score below threshold	HIGH — Soft filter
7	RR_TOO_LOW	Risk/reward ratio < 1.5	MEDIUM — Structural trade quality gate
8	FAMILY_CONFLICT	Opposite position already open for same strategy family	MEDIUM — Prevents hedge overlap
9	DUPLICATE_POSITION	Strategy already has an open position	MEDIUM — Per-strategy limit
10	CONFIRM	Confirmation gate (multi-timeframe alignment) failed	MEDIUM — Signal quality
11	ATR_FEES	ATR too small to overcome fee hurdle	MEDIUM — Low-volatility filter
12	WEEKLY_LOSS_LIMIT	Rolling 7-day loss > 6%	MEDIUM — Weekly circuit breaker
13	NO_APPROVED_STRATEGY	Strategy not in the approved promotion list	MEDIUM — Research gate
14	MARGIN_CHECK	Insufficient simulated margin	LOW — Account size constraint
15	MAX_DRAWDOWN	Historical max drawdown > 10%	LOW — Breaches overall risk limit
16	OTHER	Unmapped gate — catch-all	LOW — Diagnostic
Exposure Controls
maxOpenTrades: 5 total
maxLongPositions: 3
maxShortPositions: 3
Checked in evaluateMockTradeOpenRisk() lines 617–622
Cooldown Controls
15-minute lockout per strategy ID
Enforced by tracking last-entry timestamp per strategy
Resets after 15 minutes from last filled trade (not from last signal)
Strategy Limits
Max 1 open position per strategy at any time (DUPLICATE_POSITION)
Strategies must be in approved list (NO_APPROVED_STRATEGY)
Family-level conflict prevention (FAMILY_CONFLICT)
Risk Limits
Daily loss: 3% of starting equity
Weekly loss: 6% of starting equity
Max drawdown: 10%
Minimum R:R: 1.5
Minimum signal score: 50
SECTION 4 — RESEARCH ENGINE AUDIT
Research Cycle Flow

Daily cron: POST /api/cron/rank-strategies
  ↓
Load all closed mock trades from MongoDB (paper_trades collection)
  ↓
Group by strategy ID
  ↓
Compute per-strategy metrics:
  ├─ trade count
  ├─ win rate
  ├─ expectancy per trade
  ├─ profit factor
  └─ fee_pct_of_gross
  ↓
Apply verdict logic (researchEdgeScore.ts):
  ├─ PROMOTE: ≥12 trades, positive expectancy, fee/gross <50%, PF ≥1.1
  ├─ KEEP: ≥12 trades, positive expectancy but fee/gross ≥50% or PF <1.1
  ├─ WATCH: 5–11 trades, positive expectancy (gathering data)
  ├─ DISABLE: ≥5 trades, negative expectancy AND fee/gross >100%
  └─ INSUFFICIENT: <5 trades (no verdict)
  ↓
Update strategy rankings (stored in MongoDB or fixture files)
  ↓
Approved strategy list updated → used by mock engine for NO_APPROVED_STRATEGY gate
Signal Scoring
From scoreMockTraceRow():


finalScore = signal_score
           + min(50, (signal_score / threshold) * 10)   ← threshold bonus
           + quality_score * 0.15                        ← quality weight
           + mtf_score * 0.10                            ← multi-timeframe weight
From scoreMockResearchSignal():


finalScore = clamp(confidenceScore, 0, 100)             ← pure confidence
Confidence Scoring (Research Edge)
Trade Count	Confidence Score
< 5	0%
5–11	20%
12–19	40%
20–29	60%
30–49	75%
≥ 50	90%
Max possible: 90% (statistical humility — never 100% confident)

Strategy Ranking Criteria
Per computeVerdict() in client/src/lib/researchEdgeScore.ts:

Trade count gate (minimum 5 for any verdict, 12 for promotion)
Expectancy per trade (must be positive to promote)
Fee/gross ratio (must be < 50% to promote)
Profit factor (must be ≥ 1.1 to promote)
Win rate component (Python service: min 35%, min PF 0.95)
Strategy Health Calculation
Python StrategyScoringEngine (management.py):

Minimum 8 trades for any health score
Minimum win rate: 35%
Minimum profit factor: 0.95
Auto-disable if health score falls below threshold
Probe Trade Exclusion
Trades tagged with labels BOOTSTRAP, PROBE, DEV_FORCE, CANARY, SMOKE_TEST are excluded from all scoring metrics. This prevents synthetic/test trades from polluting strategy verdicts.

